  «text (-1450,550) 0.8 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Represents a single GPIO pin on uC. For an input operation, set\nC high then read from I. For output, set C low and set O."»
  «text (-1450,1350) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Possible implementation of micro-controller GPIO pin."»
  «text (-1475,-50) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿To C-Block\n"Micro-Controller""»
